  "notes": "Dar Al Arkan Real Estate Development Company (ticker 4300) audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/465_0_2026-03-11...). Auditor: Alluhaid & Alyahya Chartered Accountants (LYCA); auditor's report Riyadh, 14 Ramadan 1447H / 3 March 2026. The consolidated financial statements were approved by the board of directors and authorised for issue on 3 March 2026 (Note 31). Amounts are presented in thousands of Saudi Riyals ('SR 000', scale 1000). The entire filed PDF is a scanned document (no text layer); all figures transcribed from page renders. Consolidated group with a small non-controlling interest. IFRS 5: in FY2024 the group recorded a SAR 18,902 thousand net profit from discontinued operations (a disposed subsidiary, Note 29); FY2025 has none. So for FY2024 income_before_income_taxes_and_zakat is NOT carried (the reported 'Profit before zakat from continuing operations' is a continuing-operations figure); continuing_operations_income (787,938) + discontinued_operations_income (18,902) are carried and net_income = continuing + discontinued is checked. FY2025 is continuing-only and uses the standard pre-tax - tax = net bridge. income_taxes_and_zakat is 'Zakat provisions'. operating_income is the reported 'OPERATING PROFIT'; share_of_profit_associates is 'Share of net profits from associates and joint ventures'; other_income is 'Other income, net'. investment_property_value is 'Investment properties, net'; development_property_value combines 'Long-term development properties' and 'Short-term development properties' (the group's real-estate project inventory, split by expected realisation); related_party_loans is the non-current 'Loan to a related party'; long_term_investments is 'Investments in financial asset'. long_term_debt / current_debt are the non-current and current portions of 'Borrowings'. defined_benefit_obligation is 'End of service indemnities'. other_reserves combines the 'Statutory reserve' and the negative 'Other reserves'. depreciation_amortization is the single 'Depreciation' add-back on the cash-flow statement. capex is 'Purchase of property and equipment'; interest_paid is 'Finance costs paid'; zakat_paid is 'Zakat paid'. Dar Al Arkan pays no ordinary dividend. FY2025 operating cash flow was a large outflow (SAR -3.32bn) driven by SAR 4.10bn of net additions to development properties, funded by a SAR 4.40bn increase in long-term borrowings; the cash-flow closing balance equals the balance-sheet 'Cash and cash equivalents' line exactly. Statement page references are the printed FS page numbers: financial position 7, profit or loss and OCI 8, changes in equity 9, cash flows 10.",
